<statement>
<p>
Suppose that the scores on a statewide standardized test are normally distributed with a mean of 77 and a standard deviation of 4.  Estimate the percentage of scores that were</p>
<p>
(a) between 69 and 85.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="2"/> <percent/></p>
<p>
(b) above 81.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="2"/> <percent/></p>
<p>
(c) below 69.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="2"/> <percent/></p>
<p>
(d) between 69 and 89.</p>
<p>
<fillin characters="2"/> <percent/>
</p>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>95</li><li>16</li><li>2.5</li><li>97.35</li></ul></p>
</answer>

